{
 "file": "Emuqu/Sources/Services/TrailDiscoveryService.swift",
 "hash": "0fe07f690ef2df83",
 "role": "Overpass (OpenStreetMap) trail search: builds an Overpass QL radius query per activity, sends it through the shared OverpassClient, decodes relations/ways/nodes into DiscoveredTrail values (relation members and same-named ways joined end to end) with length, centroid, difficulty and descriptor, then filters by length/difficulty and keeps the maxResults nearest by distance to the nearest trackpoint.",
 "types": [
  "TrailDiscoveryService: class (Sendable, not @MainActor) — trail search service, one instance built by OverpassServices in AppDependencies.swift:636",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.Activity: enum — hiking / mountain_biking / road_cycling; maps to workout Sport",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.Difficulty: enum (Comparable) — easy<moderate<hard<expert<unknown; built from sac_scale / mtb:scale tags",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.DiscoveredTrail: struct — one search result (id rel-/way-, name, length, difficulty, centroid, trackpoints, descriptor); distance is to its nearest trackpoint",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.SearchError: enum (LocalizedError) — network / decode / rateLimited / unavailable / noResults user-facing search failure messages",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.SearchFilters: struct — activity, radius (default 10 km), min/max length, min/max difficulty, maxResults (default 25)",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.TrailEnvelope/TrailElement/TrailMember: private Decodable structs — Overpass JSON shape",
  "TrailDiscoveryService.Piece: typealias (id: Int64, nodes: [Int64]) — a run of ways joined end to end, named by one of its way ids"
 ],
 "state": [
  "mem:TrailDiscoveryService.overpass (let OverpassClient, shared with RoadGraphService)",
  "mem:TrailDiscoveryService.replyCacheSeconds (static 600 s, passed as cacheFor to OverpassClient.post)",
  "mem:TrailDiscoveryService.maxRadiusMeters (static 50_000)"
 ],
 "toplevel": "Header comment (6-34) states the design: Overpass only, named trails only, difficulty from sac_scale/mtb:scale, length from node great-circle distance, and that ascent/descent is not known (Overpass carries no elevation and nothing looks it up). Activity/Difficulty conformances (Codable, CaseIterable, Identifiable, Comparable) are synthesized; SearchError Equatable synthesized; Decodable synthesis for the private envelope structs is used by parse.",
 "units": [
